Do not create tickets from ordinary tasks or bug reports. When the developer
explicitly asks, use the existing scripts under [the ticket contract](../../docs/linear-ticket-system.md).
Include project, milestone, labels, acceptance criteria and scope; never secrets.
Report the identifier and URL. Status changes must distinguish verified branch
work from production deployment. There is no separate plan-linking step.
Prakrit's workflow is [AGENTS-prakrit.md](../../docs/agents/AGENTS-prakrit.md);
Akhil's is [AGENTS-akhil.md](../../docs/agents/AGENTS-akhil.md).
